 cleaning:{title:'Cleaning & Home Care',intro:'Cleaning advice depends on the surface, type of mess and products already used. A stubborn stain may also signal a leak or damaged material.',questions:[{label:'What kind of cleaning do you need?',options:[['bathroom','Bathroom, tiles or toilet'],['kitchen','Kitchen grease or sticky surfaces'],['stain','A stubborn stain on a floor, wall or fabric'],['move','Move-in or move-out deep clean'],['renovation','After building or renovation work'],['other','General cleaning']]},{label:'What surface is affected?',options:[['tile','Ceramic or porcelain tile'],['stone','Natural stone or unknown tile'],['wood','Wood, laminate or painted surface'],['fabric','Carpet or fabric'],['multiple','Multiple surfaces or unsure']]},{label:'Is there mould, sewage, unknown dust or a strong chemical smell?',options:[['yes','Yes'],['no','No'],['unknown','Not sure']]},{label:'Have you already used cleaning products?',options:[['bleach','Bleach or chlorine product'],['other','Another cleaning product'],['none','No products yet'],['unknown','Not sure']]}],next(a){if(a[2]!=='no')return {cause:'A possible contamination or chemical exposure concern',steps:'Avoid disturbing the affected material, keep children and pets away, ventilate only if safe and never combine cleaning products. If fumes are strong, leave the area.',pro:'Seek appropriate specialist cleaning or qualified assessment before continuing.'};if(a[0]==='renovation')return {cause:'Post-renovation dust and residue',steps:'Check what materials were used before cleaning. Avoid dry sweeping or vacuuming unknown fine construction dust with an ordinary household vacuum. Follow the contractor’s safe-cleaning instructions.',pro:'Consider professional post-renovation cleaning for large jobs or uncertain dust.'};if(a[0]==='move')return {cause:'Whole-home deep cleaning',steps:'Work room by room, from higher surfaces to floors, using products suitable for each material. Keep food areas separate from bathroom cleaning tools.',pro:'Request a professional move-in or move-out clean if the job is too large.'};if(a[1]==='stone')return {cause:'Sensitive or unidentified surface',steps:'Avoid vinegar, acidic descalers and abrasive cleaners until the surface is identified. Test a manufacturer-approved product in a hidden area.',pro:'Ask a surface-care specialist if marks persist.'};if(a[0]==='kitchen')return {cause:'Grease or cleaning-product residue may be contributing',steps:'Use a mild, surface-compatible cleaner according to its label; wipe and rinse as directed. Do not combine it with products already applied.',pro:'Consider a professional deep clean for persistent heavy grease.'};return {cause:'Surface residue or staining is possible',steps:'Identify the material, check care instructions and test a suitable cleaner in a small hidden spot. Do not scrub aggressively or mix products.',pro:'Request professional cleaning if the stain persists or the surface is easily damaged.'};}},
